 "remarks": "Absolutely stunning 3 bedroom, 3 full bath home in the Cove neighborhood! - Feels like a single family house! - Nearly new kitchen with white shaker cabinets, stainless steel appliances & granite counters! - Open layout from kitchen to living room - Living room offers a gas fireplace with shiplap feature above, and lots of light! - Primary bedroom features massive walk-in closet! - Updated bathrooms with stunning custom tile showers! - 3 bedrooms + additional room on first floor which could be a den or home office + another den / office in the lower level with another full bathroom - Private 2nd floor balcony with tons of space! - Additional stone patio off kitchen, leading out to private, fenced-in back yard! - Gas heat & central air - Washer / dryer on main level - Private driveway (left side of house) - No pets!",
